you're talking about is it's on the one hand of&nbsp;
it, Bob and Brenda can directly support the work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:41.580
I'm doing rather than whoever else, corporate&nbsp;
entity or whatever on the other side of it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:46.680
because Bob and Brenda are just two people&nbsp;
who I love. Bob and Brenda are great. They're&nbsp;&nbsp;

