you know, I'm like, well, would I ever take&nbsp;
advertising from Chevron? No. Right. Like,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:20.820
like that's problematic. So but but I think&nbsp;
there's there's huge gradations. And I and&nbsp;&nbsp;

