nuance maybe is the way I would put it. You know,&nbsp;
one of the things that's really tough with stories&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:43.800
that are more complicated than the simplest of&nbsp;
simplest stories, which is really most of them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:50.160
is that oftentimes when you introduce nuance or&nbsp;
you revise your views, you are potentially accused&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:55.140
of either flip flopping or you were originally&nbsp;
lying or you're backpedaling or whatever the case&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:59.400
may be. This comes up a lot of times with messages&nbsp;
