00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:10.980
well, listen, the vaccine in 2021, based on the&nbsp;
variant that was out there, was very effective at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:16.020
preventing transmission and infection. The virus&nbsp;
that is out there has changed. The vaccines have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:22.740
been updated and it is now more a tool for&nbsp;
preventing death and hospitalization and not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:29.160
really a tool for preventing. Oh, so you're&nbsp;
backpedaling is how what's the best way for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:34.440
people in my position or in your position to deal&nbsp;
